     "object": "obj_mi_ika_mumche_leadam",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "ומי איכא מומחה לאדם ולא הוי מומחה לבהמה? -- is there an amulet proven for a person and not for an animal?",
     "against": "p_okimta_mumche_leadam",
     "state": "answered"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection_answer",
     "object": "ans_mazla",
     "gloss_en": "אין, אדם דאית ליה מזלא מסייע ליה, בהמה דלית לה מזלא לא מסייע לה (= p_mazla_mesayea)",
     "answers": "obj_mi_ika_mumche_leadam",
     "restores": "p_okimta_mumche_leadam"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_okimta_mumche_leadam",
     "gloss_en": "[it speaks of one] proven for a person and not proven for an animal"
    }
   ]
  },
  "3": {
